aroque practice and modern harmonic thinking."}]}, {"id": "fa770e8b-40b0-47b8-bf24-d75e5f0b5746", "type": "topic", "title": "Introduction to Two-Part Counterpoint", "description": "Counterpoint sharpens attention to line, dissonance treatment, and the relationship between independence and harmony.", "children": [{"id": "d6e108b4-9a5b-4680-83cf-089a56795cd5", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Species foundations", "children": [{"id": "423e3a2f-5a52-4206-9d5f-ce3e6949f994", "type": "concept", "title": "first species"}, {"id": "13827e21-0e07-4ecc-afc0-a6261ecacb3e", "type": "concept", "title": "second species"}, {"id": "253e96df-e93b-40d6-a40c-b40243ccbecc", "type": "concept", "title": "consonance rules"}], "description": "Students learn the basic constraints and purpose of early species counterpoint."}, {"id": "49110db4-7d93-4e07-8ffd-f14c7d9d4d7d", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Dissonance control", "children": [{"id": "4e6fe756-e81e-4ed8-8335-71c67402eb94", "type": "concept", "title": "passing dissonance"}, {"id": "2611c5d8-8891-4294-bbe1-d35e84ea7e23", "type": "concept", "title": "prepared dissonance"}, {"id": "6ed416c2-8bd1-495f-82a6-149adffe6aca", "type": "concept", "title": "resolution"}], "description": "The unit connects passing dissonance and suspension treatment to broader voice leading."}, {"id": "e96ee4a7-978f-47cb-81a3-439936c383bc", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Counterpoint-to-harmony transfer", "children": [{"id": "80576198-f92b-4c14-a52b-d075804ad043", "type": "concept", "title": "outer-voice framework"}, {"id": "40fd5890-eb59-47e5-a947-ff6b0df775cc", "type": "concept", "title": "linear clarity"}, {"id": "b84f4f32-4027-4903-9577-f9fda99ebc75", "type": "concept", "title": "cadential counterpoint"}], "description": "Students apply contrapuntal thinking to cleaner part-writing and melodic design."}]}, {"id": "de8c77cb-6c99-479a-9bcd-d51715f4eaf1", "type": "topic", "title": "Keyboard, Listening, and Analytical Integration", "description": "This added unit make